    "title": "Shortest Subarray with Sum at Least K",
    "category": "Queue",
    "difficulty": "Hard",
    "problemStatement": "Given an integer array nums and an integer k, find the length of the shortest non-empty contiguous subarray whose sum is at least k. If no such subarray exists, return -1.",
